---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import CompanyLine from "../../components/CompanyLine.astro";
import { CONTACT, PRACTICE_ESTIMATE } from "../../site.config";
---
<Base title="Company names and trademarks" description="Strong Hire is not affiliated with any company it names. How we describe company interview styles, and how to reach us about a trademark.">
  <section class="stage"><div class="wrap page-head"><p class="eyebrow">Legal</p><h1>Company names and trademarks</h1></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="wrap prose">
    <CompanyLine intro="Strong Hire lets you practice for interviews at companies like" />
    <h2>What the names mean</h2>
    <p>We name companies only to describe the interviews you can practice for. Each name belongs to its owner. No company named on this site has reviewed, approved or sponsored Strong Hire, and our interviews are not any company's real interview.</p>
    <p>{PRACTICE_ESTIMATE}</p>
    <h2>How we describe interview styles</h2>
    <p>Our company profiles describe how a company's interviews usually run, in our own words, from public sources such as company career pages and published articles. We don't use questions from interviews covered by a confidentiality agreement, and we don't copy text from review sites.</p>
    <h2>Trademark and takedown requests</h2>
    <p>If you represent a company and have a concern about how we refer to it, write to <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT.legal}`}>{CONTACT.legal}</a>. We reply within two business days.</p>
  </div></section>
</Base>
